msgstr "扫描线程数"

#: src/preferences.ui:31
msgid ""
"Experimental. Only affects compression recommendations and extract duplicate "
"checks. -1 removes the scanner-specific limit; 0 uses a CPU recommendation. "
"The app may use more total threads for normal operation."
msgstr "实验功能。仅影响压缩参数推荐和解压重复检查。-1 表示不限制扫描器线程数；0 表示使用基于 CPU 的推荐值。应用在正常运行时使用的总线程数可能会更多。"

#: src/preferences.ui:51
msgid "Extraction"
msgstr "解压"

#: src/preferences.ui:54
msgid "Overwrite conflicts"
msgstr "覆盖冲突"

#: src/preferences.ui:55
msgid ""
"Experimental. When disabled, extracting to an existing output path is "
"blocked."
msgstr "实验功能。关闭后，解压到已存在的输出路径会被阻止。"

#: src/preferences.ui:68
msgid "Compression"
msgstr "压缩"

#: src/preferences.ui:71
msgid "Compression recommendations"
msgstr "压缩参数推荐"

#: src/preferences.ui:72
msgid ""
"Experimental. Enables scanning source files to recommend compression "
"parameters."
msgstr "实验功能。启用后可扫描源文件并推荐压缩参数。"

#: src/preferences.ui:83
msgid "Scan depth"
msgstr "扫描深度"

#: src/preferences.ui:84
msgid ""
"Maximum folder depth to scan for compression recommendations. Use -1 for "
"unlimited depth."
msgstr "为生成压缩建议而扫描的最大文件夹深度。使用 -1 表示不限制深度。"

#: src/preferences.ui:104
msgid "Default compression parameters"
msgstr "默认压缩参数"

#: src/preferences.ui:105
msgid "Used for normal compression and recommendation fallback."
msgstr "用于普通压缩和推荐回退。"

#: src/preferences.ui:199
msgid "Only available for 7z format."
msgstr "仅 7z 格式可用。"

#: src/ui/extract_conflict_dialog.py:43
msgid "Existing Files"
msgstr "已有文件"

#: src/ui/extract_conflict_dialog.py:64
msgid "Some extracted items already exist."
msgstr "部分解压项目已存在。"

#: src/ui/extract_conflict_dialog.py:69
msgid "Choose which existing files should be overwritten or skipped before extracting."
msgstr "请在解压前选择要覆盖或跳过的已有文件。"

#: src/ui/extract_conflict_dialog.py:89
msgid "Overwrite Selected"
msgstr "覆盖所选项"

#: src/ui/extract_conflict_dialog.py:90
msgid "Skip Selected"
msgstr "跳过所选项"

#: src/ui/extract_conflict_dialog.py:92
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "确认"

#: src/ui/extract_conflict_dialog.py:160
msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "覆盖"

#: src/ui/extract_conflict_dialog.py:161
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "跳过"

